===Etymology===
Verb form from {{inh|en|enm|goinge}}, {{m|enm|goynge}}, {{m|enm|gayng}}, variants of {{m|enm|gonde}}, {{m|enm|goonde}}, {{m|enm|gaand}}, from {{inh|en|ang|gānde}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*gēndz}}, present participle of {{der|en|gem-pro|*gēną}}, {{m|gem-pro|*gāną|t=to go}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|go|ing}}. Cognate with {{cog|fy|geanend|t=going}}, {{cog|nl|gaand|t=going}}, {{cog|de|gehend|t=going}}, {{cog|da|gående|t=going}}, {{cog|sv|gående|t=going}}.

Noun and adjective from {{inh|en|enm|going}}, {{m|enm|goyng}}, {{m|enm|gaing}}, {{m|enm|gayng}}, equivalent to {{af|en|go|-ing}}. Compare {{cog|de|Gehung}}, {{cog|ang|gang|t=a going}}. More at {{m|en|gang}}.

